{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17272","headline":"送张詹事致政归嵩山旧隐 · 权德舆","name":"送张詹事致政归嵩山旧隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解龟辞汉庭，却忆少微星。\n直指常持宪，平反更恤刑。\n闲思紫芝侣，归卧白云扃。\n明诏优筋力，安车适性灵。\n羣公来蔼蔼，独鹤去冥冥。\n想到挥金处，嵩吟枕上青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}